    {
      "id": "2120721367708336442",
      "text": "#GoBolts Cooper: \"It was tough giving up that late goal in the second and then they score 30 seconds in(to the third), and now the game is sort of in the balance. But Kuch did a Kuch thing and scored right after that to kind of snuff things out and we took it from there.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/BenjaminJReport/status/2120721367708336442",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:32:29+00:00",
      "likes": 22,
      "author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "handle": "BenjaminJReport",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038752916618817536/A5zwyb8q_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Kucherov’s natural hat trick tonight was the third of his career, which is the most in #GoBolts franchise history.",
      "quoted_author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "quoted_handle": "BenjaminJReport"
    },
    {
      "id": "2120721356262195548",
      "text": "Carlson on Kucherov: \"It's nice to score three quick ones like he did, but certainly that first one, a big play at a big-time for us, and those are huge for a team. And no, there's nothing that he does that surprises me.\" #gobolts",
      "url": "https://x.com/EddieInTheYard/status/2120721356262195548",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:32:27+00:00",
      "likes": 32,
      "author": "Eduardo A. Encina",
      "handle": "EddieInTheYard",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1048038715539566592/_nvtUMOa_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120721012975399013",
      "text": "Carlson: \"A highly talented team is going to play differently down 4 goals than than other teams...Did we play aggressive enough on our toes, or are we just sitting back too much?...We would have liked to made that change from a lot of the other games that we've been in.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/EddieInTheYard/status/2120721012975399013",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:31:05+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Eduardo A. Encina",
      "handle": "EddieInTheYard",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1048038715539566592/_nvtUMOa_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120720535558512946",
      "text": "John Carlson tonight became the fourth defenseman in #GoBolts franchise history to reach 5 points in a game, joining Doug Crossman, Pavel Kubina and Darren Raddysh. Only Crossman (3-3--6 on Nov. 7, 1992) has hit 6.",
      "url": "https://x.com/BenjaminJReport/status/2120720535558512946",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:29:11+00:00",
      "likes": 19,
      "author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "handle": "BenjaminJReport",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2038752916618817536/A5zwyb8q_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "FIVE PIECE: @TBLightning defenseman John Carlson has a career-high five points (1-4--5) tonight to reach 800 in his career. Carlson's just the fifth U.S.-born defenseman all-time to the mark (Phil Housley, Brian Leetch, Chris Chelios, Gary Suter). https://t.co/6ZqLiSlRVD",
      "quoted_author": "Benjamin Pierce",
      "quoted_handle": "BenjaminJReport"
    },
    {
      "id": "2120720306549805182",
      "text": "Jon Cooper called the scoring swings from both teams tonight \"chaos.\" \"It seems to be a Tampa-Buffalo thing.\" \"Hey, we had to do what we had to do in third period, and we did it. And so we'll take the two points and go see what we can do in Columbus.\" #GoBolts #Sabrehood",
      "url": "https://x.com/EddieInTheYard/status/2120720306549805182",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:28:16+00:00",
      "likes": 28,
